# Cutting an Overdue entry in one pane and pasting it under another project in the outline pane moves the task, which stays in the Overdue view.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Personal:
	- Book dentist
END
keys <C-w> s gO <C-x>
hide Renew passport
keys g1 G p
see - Renew passport  Personal
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
Personal:
	- Book dentist
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
END
